id: pm-t8a0x1
title: "Agent-environment exemplar: a runnable reset/step/observe/score environment built on published SDK surface alone, as the executable acceptance test for the universal-domain milestone"
description: "Fourth of the four seams pm-klxax7 owns. pm-t4d7nz requires that non-PM systems be buildable on SDK primitives alone, which is unfalsifiable until something is built; pm-iiv1gl supplies a content-addressed version-control domain as one proof. The epic argues an environment is the more demanding proof because it exercises the temporal guarantees a modelling domain does not: deterministic reset, bounded observation, recorded trajectory, reproducible verdict. Every import that escapes the published SDK entrypoints is a milestone failure with a name attached -- pm-z5pmf8 already records that the SDK lifecycle surface re-exports CLI command modules, so an author composing a step today reaches through the CLI layer. Deliberately excludes any model, policy, training loop or RL framework dependency. Duplicate check: read pm-iiv1gl, pm-nfrhf0, pm-li2fj5, pm-mi2x, pm-rbcvt2 (closed) and pm-t4d7nz; this exemplar is complementary to pm-iiv1gl and neither subsumes the other."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[4]: agent-environment,"area:sdk",conformance,rl
created_at: "2026-08-01T09:49:21.045Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-01T20:25:38.578Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 1440
acceptance_criteria: "One episode driven end to end in CI on every release candidate: seeded reset, scripted action sequence, bounded observation per step with published cost honoured, verdict at termination, trajectory replaying to the same verdict from immutable history alone; two runs on different machines produce byte-identical trajectories; the build fails if any import escapes the published SDK entrypoints; no model, policy or RL framework dependency enters this repository"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Convert 'the SDK is complete enough to build a foreign domain' from an assertion into a mechanical check
value: SDK boundary gaps surface as compile errors instead of as author complaints; the universal-domain milestone gains a falsifier
why_now: The three other programme seams are now filed; the exemplar is what proves they compose rather than merely coexist
parent: pm-klxax7
risk: medium
confidence: medium
